  "content": "<h3><img src=\"https://coolsimulations.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/infinitywaterbucket_logo_HD.png\" alt=\"無限水桶\" width=\"1024\" height=\"512\"></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>無限水桶模組介紹：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">無限水桶是個小型模組，允許透過鐵砧為水桶附加「無限」附魔，獲得可攜帶的無限水源。亦可對空桶進行附魔，創造無限液體黑洞。透過設定檔還能為熔岩桶、牛奶桶和粉雪桶（3.0.0+版本）附加此附魔。</span></p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>無限水桶需求：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組支援<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprojects.neoforged.net%252fneoforged%252fneoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>及<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flegacyfabric.net%252fdownloads.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legacy Fabric</a>。Fabric版本（含Legacy）可選裝Fabric API。<br></span></p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>主要功能：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用Mixin技術實現空桶與水桶的無限附魔<br>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">可搭配發射器放置無限水源或吸取無限液體</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">禁止附魔空桶對牛擠奶</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">禁止附魔桶捕撈魚類與六角恐龍</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">允許無限填充/消耗鍋釜</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可透過設定檔啟用以下桶類附魔：\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">熔岩桶</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">牛奶桶</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">粉雪桶</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">伺服器端運作，但客戶端未安裝會出現顯示異常</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">內建更新檢查器</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">模組相容性（1.20+版本停止支援）：\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinity-water-bucket/settings/https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caves-and-cliffs-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">洞穴與山崖回溯版</a> - 禁止捕撈六角恐龍與鍋釜互動</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs/\" rel=\"nofollow\">全生物擠奶（Forge版</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs-fabric/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric版</a> - 禁止附魔空桶對支援生物擠奶</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/get-in-the-bucket-mod/\" rel=\"nofollow\">進桶模組</a> - 禁止附魔桶捕捉生物</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">注意：本模組與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinity-mending-unnerf\" rel=\"nofollow\">無限修復強化</a>不相容</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://coolsimulations.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/InfinityWaterBucketPreview.gif\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></strong></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Minecraft版本：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">請勿要求移植舊版Minecraft。coolsim會盡快更新至最新版本，懇請耐心等候。<br></span></p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>授權與模組包：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎將無限水桶加入任何模組包，但請標註作者coolsim。禁止以任何形式重新發佈本模組。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
